# Payments & Settlement (MVP)

## Weekend rollup

On **Sunday 7:00 PM IST**, system notifies the weekend fee calculation (Sat and/or Sun) and asks players to:

1. Pay via UPI
2. Copy UTR
3. Upload payment screenshot (compress aggressively; keep legible)
4. Mark payment done in-app

## Amount

Per player per match:

- Match fee share (warmup fee or tournament allocation ÷ participants)
- \+ ₹100 if carpool opted

## Reminders

- **10:00 AM** and **7:00 PM IST** daily listing unpaid players
- Continue until settlement fully paid / offline-marked

## Admin

- May mark player payment(s) as paid **offline**
- Confirms settlement complete when all lines cleared

## Storage

- Screenshots in Supabase Storage with size limits + server/client compression before upload
